  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of Basic Education System</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejoramiento Sistema Educacin Primaria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PURPOSE OF THE PROGRAM IS TO IMPROVE THE QUALITY OF THE BASIC EDUCATION THROUGH THE FOUR FOLLOWING PRINCIPAL ACTIONS: A) DEVELOPMENT OF TEXTS AND MATERIAL SCHOLASTIC; B) TRAINING OF TEACHERS C) IMPROVEMENT OF THE INSTITUTIONAL EFFICIENCY OF THE SEEBAS; AND D) REHABILITATION OF SCHOOLS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
